The Inkling-2 attention core in patches/ follows the fp32 attention arithmetic of
tf_ik_attention in kortexa-ai's TensorFold fork (https://github.com/kortexa-ai/TensorFold,
by francip) at commit e2614fe, Apache License 2.0. Files adapted from it keep their
Apache-2.0 header, name that source and commit, and say that they were modified. That
fork's NOTICE is TensorFold's own, quoted above.

